Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add the engine, ledger and campaign

---
 package.json         | 10 ++++++++++
 src/campaign.mjs     |  4 ++++
 src/engine.mjs       |  9 +++++++++
 src/ledger.mjs       | 12 ++++++++++++
 test/engine.test.mjs | 13 +++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 48 insertions(+)
